\newlabel{tab:drozy}{{6}{9}{DROZY LOTO evaluation (13 subjects with $\geq $2 valid tests; negative COR indicates predictions anti-correlated with KSS). All methods fail under sparse per-test labeling, confirming that epoch-level regression is fundamentally incompatible with DROZY's annotation design}{table.6}{}}
